1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,215
M: Is there anything else I can get you, ma'am?

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:04,700
W: Yes, I would like to have this coffee refilled.

3
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:07,100
Also, could you bring me the menu again?

4
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:09,580
I want to take a look at your choice of pies.

5
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,370
I overheard a couple saying how good your pies are here.

6
00:00:13,705 --> 00:00:16,360
M: You must be from out of town if you don't know about our pies.

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:20,220
In fact, most of our customers come here for our apple pie.

8
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:25,820
Of course that doesn't mean that our food is not good, it's just that our pies are out of this world.

9
00:00:26,485 --> 00:00:27,260
You have to try it.

10
00:00:27,605 --> 00:00:28,410
W: Is that right?

11
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,840
I guess you leave me no choice but to try it.

12
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:32,910
I'll have the apple pie, please.
